106 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 36 0 R/T(Our key English Australia QLD branch professional development event \(PD FEST\) excites me every year!  I love how one event can bring so many amazing teachers, managers and presenters together into one place from our wonderful sector.  It\220s a day when we can all come together, relax, catch-up with familiar faces, connect with new networks, quench our thirst for some PD \205 and just take some time out from the busy world we find ourselves in. )/E(Our key English Australia QLD branch professional development event \(PD FEST\) excites me every year!  I love how one event can bring so many amazing teachers, managers and presenters together into one place from our wonderful sector.  It\220s a day when we can all come together, relax, catch-up with familiar faces, connect with new networks, quench our thirst for some PD \205 and just take some time out from the busy world we find ourselves in. )/Pg 10 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

107 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 36 0 R/T(I have never missed a PD Fest event in Brisbane.  Whether its your first one, or you\220ve come to every event \205 I\220m sure you will agree with me, sometimes the hardest part is choosing which session to go to!  I promise you won\220t be disappointed with the amazing array of presentations this year. )/E(I have never missed a PD Fest event in Brisbane.  Whether its your first one, or you\220ve come to every event \205 I\220m sure you will agree with me, sometimes the hardest part is choosing which session to go to!  I promise you won\220t be disappointed with the amazing array of presentations this year. )/Pg 10 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

108 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 36 0 R/T(A huge thank you to everyone who submitted an abstract, and if you\220re a first-time presenter \205 congratulations!  This is such a collegial event, it\220s a wonderful launch-pad to share and inspire others with your passion and practice.  Our passionate presenters have put a lot of time into preparing for this event, and a big thanks go to you as well as to everyone who makes this event possible \(including Sophie O\220Keefe, and the QLD PD Fest committee, as well as UQ for hosting us\).)/E(A huge thank you to everyone who submitted an abstract, and if you\220re a first-time presenter \205 congratulations!  This is such a collegial event, it\220s a wonderful launch-pad to share and inspire others with your passion and practice.  Our passionate presenters have put a lot of time into preparing for this event, and a big thanks go to you as well as to everyone who makes this event possible \(including Sophie O\220Keefe, and the QLD PD Fest committee, as well as UQ for hosting us\).)/Pg 10 0 R/K[3]>>
