130 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 371 0 R/T(Each year, English Australia delivers statebased PD Fests\204local, high-engagement professional development events where teachers present sessions to their peers. Attendees vote for the most impactful or innovative presentation in their state. The winning presenters become Bright Ideas Winners and are sponsored to attend the English Australia Conference, where they present their work in dedicated conference sessions.)/E(Each year, English Australia delivers statebased PD Fests\204local, high-engagement professional development events where teachers present sessions to their peers. Attendees vote for the most impactful or innovative presentation in their state. The winning presenters become Bright Ideas Winners and are sponsored to attend the English Australia Conference, where they present their work in dedicated conference sessions.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[3]>>
