205 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 411 0 R/T(Strategic learning, analysis, and \217Young\220 academic voice [SLAY] in the age of AI - Presented by Mia Tarau, Lorna Clark & Chanelle Swanepoel \(1.30-2.00\))/E(Strategic learning, analysis, and \217Young\220 academic voice [SLAY] in the age of AI - Presented by Mia Tarau, Lorna Clark & Chanelle Swanepoel \(1.30-2.00\))/Pg 17 0 R/K[0]>>
