222 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 420 0 R/T(How I learned to stop worrying and love CoPilot: Fast, practical AI for busy teachers - Presented by Ben Arnot \(1.30-2.00\))/E(How I learned to stop worrying and love CoPilot: Fast, practical AI for busy teachers - Presented by Ben Arnot \(1.30-2.00\))/Pg 18 0 R/K[0]>>
endobj

223 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 421 0 R/T(Coulda, woulda, shoulda: When grammar, meaning and culture collide - Presented by Sermin Erden \(1.30-2.00\))/E(Coulda, woulda, shoulda: When grammar, meaning and culture collide - Presented by Sermin Erden \(1.30-2.00\))/Pg 18 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

224 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 422 0 R/T(Navigating the Whys and the hows of being an early career ELICOS teacher - Presented by Jo Kwai & Donna Cook \(1.30-2.00\))/E(Navigating the Whys and the hows of being an early career ELICOS teacher - Presented by Jo Kwai & Donna Cook \(1.30-2.00\))/Pg 18 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

225 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 423 0 R/E<>/Pg 18 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

