<</Title(Our key English Australia QLD branch professional development event \(PD FEST\) excites me every year!  I love how one event can bring so many amazing teachers, managers and presenters together into one place from our wonderful sector.  It\220s a day when we can all come together, relax, catch-up with familiar faces, connect with new networks, quench our thirst for some PD \205 and just take some time out from the busy world we find ourselves in.)/Dest[10 0 R/Fit]/Parent 445 0 R/Next 650 0 R>>
