<</Title(I have never missed a PD Fest event in Brisbane.  Whether its your first one, or you\220ve come to every event \205 I\220m sure you will agree with me, sometimes the hardest part is choosing which session to go to!  I promise you won\220t be disappointed with the amazing array of presentations this year.)/Dest[10 0 R/Fit]/Parent 445 0 R/Prev 533 0 R/Next 704 0 R>>
