704 0 obj
<</Title(A huge thank you to everyone who submitted an abstract, and if you\220re a first-time presenter \205 congratulations!  This is such a collegial event, it\220s a wonderful launch-pad to share and inspire others with your passion and practice.  Our passionate presenters have put a lot of time into preparing for this event, and a big thanks go to you as well as to everyone who makes this event possible \(including Sophie O\220Keefe, and the QLD PD Fest committee, as well as UQ for hosting us\).)/Dest[10 0 R/Fit]/Parent 445 0 R/Prev 650 0 R/Next 705 0 R>>
endobj

705 0 obj
<</Title(Investing in ourselves and our PD is important.  I\220m looking forward to our closing plenary speaker who is going to talk about  Teacher Wellbeing.)/Dest[10 0 R/Fit]/Parent 445 0 R/Prev 704 0 R/Next 651 0 R>>
endobj

