<</Title(A multi-lingual ESL trainer with 10 years industry experience having worked as an English Assistant in Paris before embarking on a career in the cooperate and VET RTO world during which time I ran PD workshops and training for employees focusing on professional growth and career advancement. Moving into the ESL industry in Brisbane ignited my passion for supporting international students in the classroom, specifically looking at ways to catapult their progress and build their self-confidence!)/Dest[16 0 R/Fit]/Parent 713 0 R/Next 771 0 R>>
