759 0 obj
<</Title(I work at UQ College as part of the assessment team producing tests for the English language pathways programs and tests for use in the wider university. I have a passion for item writing and continuing to develop my own skills as well as the skills of other item writers and teachers, especially in the age of AI where these skills are in danger of being eroded.)/Dest[16 0 R/Fit]/Parent 713 0 R/Prev 771 0 R>>
